# Open source licences

VaultShelf is distributed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 because its novel-reading core incorporates and adapts GPL-3.0 code from Legado / 阅读 3.0.

## VaultShelf / Legado

Legado source: https://github.com/LegadoTeam/legado

Pinned parser source commit: `62003ce732a7e30602754d28996da7f98b9ea296`

VaultShelf's adapted reading, pagination, page-turning and EPUB parsing code is GPL-3.0. The complete GPL-3.0 text is bundled in this APK as `gpl-3.0.txt`.

## Gander heritage

VaultShelf started from the Gander Android file viewer by Arjun Maniyani. Gander-originated source retains its MIT copyright and notice. The complete original MIT text is bundled as `gander-mit.txt`.

Gander source: https://github.com/mokshablr/gander

## Bundled document-viewer libraries

The full notices and licence texts for the JavaScript/document-rendering libraries inherited from Gander are bundled as `viewer-licences.md`.

VaultShelf remains offline: these libraries and their licence files are bundled locally and are not fetched at runtime.
